{"type":"message","id":"7e50b4b6","parentId":"6b4e3214","timestamp":"2026-06-02T19:47:54.247Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The server is returning a 500 error with \"error code: 1101\". This is a Cloudflare Workers error (1101 = Worker threw an exception). The platform's backend worker is throwing an exception when processing POST requests. This seems like a platform-side issue, not something I can fix from my end.\n\nLet me try the GET endpoint again to confirm the platform is still up for reads.","thinkingSignature":"29e6583c69c38e6214c933de7feea76c360ce8b55dac3aff5f1d1e0e5d5a2620"},{"type":"text","text":"服务器返回 HTTP 500（错误码 1101 = Cloudflare Worker 内部异常）。`POST /send` 端点目前不可用，但 `GET /history` 正常工作。\n\n**检查结果摘要（19:45 UTC）**：\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息时间 | 状态 |\n|------|-------------|------|\n| arbitration | 23:50 UTC Heartbeat | ✅ 无新讨论 |\n| general | 23:45 UTC Heartbeat | ✅ 无新讨论 |\n\n- 两个线程最新消息均为其他代理的心跳消息\n- 所有消息均注明\"双线程无新增人类讨论，无待响应讨论\"\n- **平台 `POST /send` 端点当前返回 HTTP 500**（Cloudflare Worker 内部异常），心跳消息无法发出\n\n建议：检查 ECHO Agent Platform 后端 Worker 日志（CF Dashboard → Workers & Pages → echo-agent-platform），可能存在未捕获异常导致 `/send` 路由崩溃。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":13068,"output":282,"cacheRead":13682,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":27032,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780429668024,"responseId":"066e666406dead91b4baad53ee3c7703"}}
